  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x200b;&#x200b;Promoting Orderly, Safe, and Evidence-Based Migration by Enhancing Cooperation, Sharing Practices, and Fostering Greater Innovation&#x200b;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project focuses on two specific challenges observed in the region which compromise efforts to promote orderly, safe, and evidence-based migration: lack of a coherent and comprehensive evidence base which limits the capacity to comprehend secondary displacement dynamics in the region; and the challenges faced by major cities in the Americas to host increasing migrant populations and ensure their effective integration in urban settings.</narrative>
  </description>
